---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import AtmosphericCanvas from '../../components/AtmosphericCanvas.astro';
import GoldWaveform from '../../components/GoldWaveform.astro';
import GradientVideo from '../../components/GradientVideo.astro';
import HeroVideo from '../../components/HeroVideo.astro';
import missionImg from '../../assets/images/purpose-direction/institution.png';
import govImg from '../../assets/images/purpose-direction/government.png';
import ngoImg from '../../assets/images/cases/02-education-evaluation-india.jpg';
import philImg from '../../assets/images/purpose-direction/donate.png';

const sectors = [
  {
    id: 'gov',
    title: 'Government',
    image: govImg,
    desc: 'Building AI into public systems, frontline decision-making and workforce capability, within real policy, data and operational constraints.',
  },
  {
    id: 'ngo',
    title: 'Nonprofits',
    image: ngoImg,
    desc: 'Connecting programme evidence, partner knowledge and workflows to strengthen strategy, programme operations and delivery.',
  },
  {
    id: 'phil',
    title: 'Philanthropy',
    image: philImg,
    desc: 'Using portfolio evidence and shared infrastructure to strengthen investment decisions, grantee capability and responsible adoption.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Purpose & Direction | Mission and Vision | APLYD"
  description="APLYD's mission and vision: helping institutions make better decisions at scale, toward intelligence embedded across public institutions."
  keywords="APLYD Purpose, AI Mission, Public Sector AI Vision, Institutional AI Capability, Responsible AI Adoption, Civic AI Infrastructure, AI for Global Development, Digital Transformation Strategy"
>
  <div class="pt-20 sm:pt-24 lg:pt-28">
    {/* ============================ HERO ============================ */}
    <section class="hero-internal-section bg-navy text-white py-10 sm:py-14 lg:py-16 min-h-[360px] sm:min-h-[440px] lg:min-h-[500px] flex flex-col justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
      {/* Emotional Thematic Stock Video */}
      <HeroVideo
        src="/video/purpose.mp4"
        overlayOpacity={0.6}
      />

      <div class="container-x relative z-10 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
        <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-display font-light text-white leading-[1.08] text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight">
          Why we exist, and where we're headed
        </h1>

        <p class="max-w-3xl text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-light text-pale-navy/95 leading-relaxed">
          Two statements sit behind everything we do. The first is our purpose today. The second is the future that work is building toward.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================ RICH ATMOSPHERIC CANVAS ============================ */}
    <AtmosphericCanvas>
      {/* ============================ SECTION 1: OUR MISSION ============================ */}
      <section class="relative z-10 py-10 sm:py-16">
        <div class="container-x space-y-10 sm:space-y-14">
          
          {/* Mission Monument */}
          <div class="rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6 lg:col-span-7 relative z-10">
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-navy leading-tight">
                Our mission
              </h2>

              <blockquote class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-navy leading-snug">
                To help institutions build the systems, capabilities, and intelligence to make better decisions at scale.
              </blockquote>

              <p class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-mid-navy leading-relaxed font-normal pt-1 sm:pt-2">
                The challenge in public-sector AI is not only developing the technology. It is creating the conditions for institutions to adopt, operate and improve it. We work across that journey, from identifying the decisions and services where AI can add value, to understanding delivery realities, building systems that fit institutional workflows, and measuring what changes in practice.
              </p>
            </div>

            {/* Editorial Imagery Visual Frame */}
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative z-10 w-full h-[220px] sm:h-[300px] lg:h-[340px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-hair">
              <Image
                src={missionImg}
                alt="Institutional intelligence and decision making"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
                widths={[360, 600, 800]}
                sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* 3 Sector Focus Showcase */}
          <div class="pt-6 sm:pt-10 space-y-6 sm:space-y-8" id="sector-horizons-section">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8" id="sector-horizons-grid">
              {sectors.map((sec, idx) => (
                <div class={`sector-card sector-card-${sec.id} sector-card-${idx} rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between`} data-sector={sec.id}>
                  <div class="space-y-4 relative z-10">
                    <div class="relative w-full h-44 sm:h-52 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-hair/90 shadow-sm bg-navy/5 group/img">
                      <Image
                        src={sec.image}
                        alt={sec.title}
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
                        widths={[360, 600]}
                        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw"
                      />
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-navy">
                      {sec.title}
                    </h3>

                    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-mid-navy leading-relaxed font-normal">
                      {sec.desc}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ============================ SECTION 2: OUR VISION ============================ */}
      <section class="relative z-10 py-10 sm:py-16">
        <div class="container-x">
          <div class="gradient-navy-mesh gradient-sheen rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
            <GradientVideo variant="gold" overlayOpacity={0.58} />
            <GoldWaveform alpha="1.2" />

            <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl space-y-6 sm:space-y-8">
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
                Our vision
              </h2>

              <blockquote class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-white leading-snug">
                Intelligence embedded across public institutions, enabling faster, fairer, and more informed decisions.
              </blockquote>

              <div class="space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl font-light text-pale-navy/95 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                  The measure of progress is not the number of pilots launched, but whether systems can be adopted, sustained and improved within the institutions they are designed to serve. That means building for continuity across changes in staff, resources and operating conditions, with the governance and evidence required to support long-term use.
                </p>
                <p>
                  A system that depends indefinitely on an external vendor does not create durable institutional capability. We build toward institutions that can operate, govern and improve their own AI systems, with ownership and capability developed from the outset.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ============================ CTA ============================ */}
      <section class="relative z-10 py-8 sm:py-14">
        <div class="container-x">
          <div class="rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 sm:gap-8 card-interactive-sheen final-cta-card">
            <div class="max-w-2xl relative z-10">
              <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-gold mb-2">Our Approach</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-navy mb-3">
                See our approach
              </h3>
              <p class="text-base text-mid-navy leading-relaxed font-normal">
                How APLYD moves an institution from the decision worth improving, through build, to independent assurance.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto">
              <Button href="/services/our-approach" variant="primary" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center justify-center shadow-sm">
                See our approach &rarr;
              </Button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </AtmosphericCanvas>
  </div>
</Base>
